# Unified diffs applied by tools/capi_sync.py to the vendored Modules/ files
# (capi-design.md §8).  Edit the files under capi/modules, then run
# `tools/capi_sync.py --record`; the `#` notes before each diff are kept.
#
# Modules built unmodified, with what makes them work:
#   _collections  defaultdict: DICT + NATIVE.  Patched below: no
#                 OrderedDict export (see the note of the diff).
#   _pickle       _Py_Mangle/_Py_IsPrivateName exported by D (P1).
